<title>USA: Toll Brothers sets stock repurchase.</title>
<headline>Toll Brothers sets stock repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toll Brothers Inc Thursday said its board has authorized the repurchase of up to three million shares of its common stock in order to contribute to employee benefit plans.</p>
<p>Purchase of the shares, with a par value of one cent, will replace a previously announced repurchase program. Toll Brothers builds and arranges financing for luxury single-family homes.</p>
</text>
